# corpus/assist/en_basic.ass - cau tieng Anh + loi mong doi (EN v1 "grammar
# assistant" P4-EN; mirror cua vi_basic.ass - Fassist-43).
# Dinh dang: <cau>\t<kind1,kind2,...>   (cot kinds rong = cau sach)
# kind EN v1 (chi dung kind DA CO trong IssueKind): duplicate_word
#       | space_before_punct | space_after_punct | double_space
#       | lowercase_sentence_start
# Ghi chu: cau duoc kiem tra nhu FRAGMENT (check) - ky tu dau doan KHONG coi
# la dau cau that; de test "hoa dau cau" hay viet "Hello. how are you".
# Chinh sach lap tu HOP LE (phan EN cua Fassist-94/96): "that that" (menh de
# quan he chong), "had had" (qua khu hoan thanh), "very very" (tang nghia)
# KHONG phai loi -> engine EN can danh sach cho phep rieng (giong
# INTENTIONAL_REPEATS cua ban VI). "no no" (tu choi nhấn) phai viet "No, no"
# -> van la loi. Tu 1 ky tu ("a a", "I I") KHONG bao lap tu (tranh bao gia).
# Chu thuong dau cau: kind hien chi chi bat DAU CAU THAT (sau . ! ?);
# "i" roi rac giua cau la kind v2 lowercase_pronoun (en_proposed_rules.ass).
# Chinh sach v2 (CHUA co trong tap nay de tranh phuc tap): tach cau theo
# viet tat (a.m./e.g./U.S./Mr.), trich dan, homophone (their/there).
# CANH BAO TICH HOP: assist/tests/corpus.rs TU DONG nap moi file .ass nen
# tap nay chi XANH khi engine bo gate L0 cho cau tieng Anh (hien tai
# is_vietnamese() lam cau toan ASCII -> 0 loi) + implement 5 luat EN v1.
# Test: assist/tests/corpus.rs (chay CI 3 OS).
#
# --- group: lap tu (L1/L2 EN) ---
the the book is on the table	duplicate_word@4-7
she she wants to come with us	duplicate_word@4-7
we we went to the park yesterday	duplicate_word
he he said nothing at all	duplicate_word
I saw an an old photo of us	duplicate_word
they they arrived late last night	duplicate_word
is is this the right way	duplicate_word
when when did you get here	duplicate_word
and and then we all went home	duplicate_word
no no that is not what I meant	duplicate_word
