# --- group: cau sach - lap tu HOP LE (Fassist-94 phan EN) ---
# "that that" = menh de quan he chong; "had had" = qua khu hoan thanh;
# "very very" = tang nghia (giong "rất rất" cua ban VI) -> 0 loi.
I know that that is true.
He had had breakfast before we arrived.
It is very very cold today.
A university is an hour away.
He said that that book was his.
By the time we arrived, they had had lunch.
